---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import App from '../components/App.tsx';
---

<Layout 
  title="16-0 Play | The Ultimate Cricket Strategy Game"
  description="Play the ultimate 16-0 cricket simulator. Build your greatest playing XI, master cricket team management, and achieve the perfect 16-0 challenge."
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <!-- Open Graph / Facebook -->
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://16-0play.com/" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="16-0 Play | The Ultimate Cricket Strategy Game" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Play the ultimate 16-0 cricket simulator. Build your greatest playing XI, master cricket team management, and achieve the perfect 16-0 challenge." />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://16-0play.com/og-image.png" />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="16-0play" />
    
    <!-- Twitter -->
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:url" content="https://16-0play.com/" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="16-0 Play | The Ultimate Cricket Strategy Game" />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="Play the ultimate 16-0 cricket simulator. Build your greatest playing XI, master cricket team management, and achieve the perfect 16-0 challenge." />
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://16-0play.com/og-image.png" />
  
    <!-- FAQ JSON-LD -->
    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is 16-0play?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>16-0play is a cricket strategy and team-building game where players create their ultimate all-time cricket XI and attempt to achieve the impossible: a perfect 16-0 season.</p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What does 16-0 mean in 16-0play?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>16-0 represents a perfect, undefeated season where your cricket team wins all 16 matches consecutively without a single loss.</p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I play 16-0play?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Simply select your players to form a squad, set your lineup, and start simulating matches. Use strategic decision-making to manage your team through the 16-game season.</p>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How are match results calculated?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"<p>Results are determined by a robust simulation engine weighing your team's batting, bowling, form, and chemistry ratings against the opponent's stats, with some random variance representing the unpredictability of cricket.</p>"}}]}
    </script>
    
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://16-0play.com/" />

    <!-- WebGameRank SDK -->
    <script is:inline src="https://webgamerank.com/sdk.js" data-key="gr_B7aqKutjBBiZJBQSffuf6gVq" async></script>
  </Fragment>

  <!-- Game React App -->
  <App client:only="react" />

  <!-- Content Section -->
  <div class="w-full bg-[var(--color-canvas)] border-t border-[var(--color-hairline)]">
    <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 md:py-20 text-[var(--color-body)] text-base leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-[var(--color-ink)] tracking-tight">The Ultimate Cricket Strategy Simulator</h1>
      
      <p class="text-lg">
        Welcome to <strong>16-0play</strong>, a browser-based cricket strategy game that challenges you to build the greatest playing XI ever assembled and attempt to achieve the impossible: a perfect 16-0 season.
      </p>
      
      <p>
        Inspired by franchise cricket formats and the depth of sports management simulators, 16-0play requires true strategic thinking. Success isn't just about selecting players with the highest individual ratings. You need to balance batting depth, bowling variations, form, and team chemistry to navigate unpredictable match scenarios. 
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 py-6">
        <div class="bg-[var(--color-canvas-soft)] p-6 rounded-xl border border-[var(--color-hairline)] shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)] mb-3">Build Your Dream XI</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-mute)]">Draft from a massive database of current superstars and legendary icons. Find the right combination of aggressive openers, steady middle-order anchors, and lethal wicket-takers to build a balanced squad.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-[var(--color-canvas-soft)] p-6 rounded-xl border border-[var(--color-hairline)] shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)] mb-3">Master the Engine</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-mute)]">Matches are simulated using a comprehensive engine that accounts for player roles, recent form factors, and team synergy. Every decision you make impacts your win probability.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>
        One loss ends the dream. Sixteen wins creates history. Whether you want to casually draft a team of your favorite players or dive deep into the analytics to climb the global leaderboard, your journey to the perfect season starts here.
      </p>
    </article>

    <!-- FAQ Section -->
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 md:py-16 border-t border-[var(--color-hairline)]">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)] mb-8 tracking-tight">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <details class="group bg-[var(--color-canvas-soft)] rounded-xl open:bg-[var(--color-canvas-soft-2)] transition-all duration-300 border border-[var(--color-hairline)] shadow-sm">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-[var(--color-ink)] hover:text-yellow-600 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-lg">What is the 16-0 challenge?</span>
            <span class="transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180 text-[var(--color-mute)] group-hover:text-yellow-600">
              <svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-[var(--color-body)] px-6 pb-6 text-base leading-relaxed">
            <p>The 16-0 challenge is the ultimate test in cricket gaming. It requires you to build your all-time greatest playing XI, manage them through a full season, and achieve a perfect, undefeated record: 16 wins, 0 losses.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-[var(--color-canvas-soft)] rounded-xl open:bg-[var(--color-canvas-soft-2)] transition-all duration-300 border border-[var(--color-hairline)] shadow-sm">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-[var(--color-ink)] hover:text-yellow-600 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-lg">How do I build my greatest playing XI?</span>
            <span class="transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180 text-[var(--color-mute)] group-hover:text-yellow-600">
              <svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-[var(--color-body)] px-6 pb-6 text-base leading-relaxed">
            <p>You can choose from a vast roster of legendary players and modern superstars. Success isn't just about picking the highest-rated players; you must balance batting depth, bowling strength, all-rounders, and team chemistry.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group bg-[var(--color-canvas-soft)] rounded-xl open:bg-[var(--color-canvas-soft-2)] transition-all duration-300 border border-[var(--color-hairline)] shadow-sm">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-medium cursor-pointer list-none p-6 text-[var(--color-ink)] hover:text-yellow-600 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-lg">What happens if I lose a match?</span>
            <span class="transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180 text-[var(--color-mute)] group-hover:text-yellow-600">
              <svg fill="none" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-[var(--color-body)] px-6 pb-6 text-base leading-relaxed">
            <p>If you lose a match, the dream of a perfect 16-0 season is over. However, you can still play out the rest of the season to secure a spot on the global leaderboard, such as a respectable 10-6 or 14-2 record, before trying again.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
